{"op":"add","path":"/elements/answer-block","value":{"type":"TextBlock","props":{"content":"In March 2024, net new MRR rose by 9000 (approximately 6%) relative to February 2024. The waterfall breaks this into three components: new customer MRR shifted by 7800, expansion MRR shifted by 2100, and churn impact was -900. The Enterprise plan accounted for 52.2% of the total jump (4700).","variant":"insight"},"children":[]}}
